{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Shadow of the Yokai,&quot; Navigate through atmospheric, procedurally-generated rooms filled with aggressive creatures, each more deadly than the last. Avoid fatal traps at every turn, rampaging through floods and infernos.\u00a0Armed with an arsenal of weapons, engage in intense hack-and-slash combat that will test your skills and reflexes as you turn your foes into bloody-geysers.\u00a0Solve challenging puzzles and unlock upgrades to enhance your abilities. Will you conquer the shadows, or will the Yokai claim your soul...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/513c0f6af33a243fd889c392f9fa3fe6.poster.avif?t=1746768905\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/513c0f6af33a243fd889c392f9fa3fe6.webm?t=1746768905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/513c0f6af33a243fd889c392f9fa3fe6.mp4?t=1746768905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a fatal duel for his village's sovereignty, Kazuo is left to bleed-out at the feet of the Yokai clan. Their Daimyo, Tokugawa cackles with laughter, placing a curse upon Kazuo's soul. After being reborn, Kazuo awakens to find his village under-sieged by blood-thirsty Yokai. Kazuo left only with his fists and samurai spirit, must protect his village and end Tokugawa's reign for good, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Weapons to Unlock, each with their own charge-attack and special ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Grappling Kunai, used to bring the fight to you or traverse the battlegrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Devastating Kick, to push away enemies and break their guard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Vicious Beasts await you, everything from Undead Wolves to Thieving Kappas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-Generated Levels vary; trap-placement, grapple-points, climate-modifiers, and more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/75a66ff950813f0880bb9d6ba8e6ec03.poster.avif?t=1746768905\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/75a66ff950813f0880bb9d6ba8e6ec03.webm?t=1746768905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/75a66ff950813f0880bb9d6ba8e6ec03.mp4?t=1746768905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Gameplay Teaser Music: Darren Curtis - Samura Sake Showdown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719250?t=1746768905","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/d2b189fe95c52b30aa21d1640bf7c912bf246188/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746768905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/3876136ab49d1bb7832b17a6c18e499281585308/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746768905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/3876136ab49d1bb7832b17a6c18e499281585308/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746768905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descr