/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Weapons to Unlock, each with their own charge-attack and special ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Grappling Kunai, used to bring the fight to you or traverse the battlegrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Devastating Kick, to push away enemies and break their guard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Vicious Beasts await you, everything from Undead Wolves to Thieving Kappas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-Generated Levels vary; trap-placement, grapple-points, climate-modifiers, and more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/75a66ff950813f0880bb9d6ba8e6ec03.poster.avif?t=1746768905\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/75a66ff950813f0880bb9d6ba8e6ec03.webm?t=1746768905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/extras/75a66ff950813f0880bb9d6ba8e6ec03.mp4?t=1746768905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Gameplay Teaser Music: Darren Curtis - Samura Sake Showdown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Xander Wise"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719250/66539a1188c44b77f9ac44137981b2abc7b18586/header.jpg?t=1746768905","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Wise Productions. All rights reserved. Wise Productions Logo, Shadow of the Yokai, and the Shadow of the Yokai logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Wise Productions","linux_requirements":{"